sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant GW as GatewayRuntimeService
  participant R as RocketMqBrokerForwardingRelay
  participant B as RocketMQ broker
  participant RT as TestAgentRuntime (test)
  participant CON as RocketMqBrokerForwardingConsumer (gateway resp)
  C->>GW: routeClientRequest
  GW->>GW: dispatchRequest: enqueue→claim→produce→markAcked (SYNC)
  GW->>R: produce(record)
  R->>B: send T_invocation_req
  GW->>GW: acceptWindow: poll loop
  RT->>B: poll T_invocation_req (LitePull, DIRECT — no relay)
  Note over B: T_invocation_deliver provisioned, UNUSED
  RT->>RT: produceResponse
  RT->>B: send T_invocation_resp_out
  GW->>CON: poll(now)
  CON->>B: poll T_invocation_resp_out
  B-->>CON: BrokerInboundMessage
  CON-->>GW: msg
  GW->>GW: classify(eventType) → IngressResponse
  GW-->>C: IngressResponse
  Note over GW,B: ⚠ NO governance between hops (dedup/tenant/corr/audit) — relay absent, zero coverage
